 "description": "Create a company-scoped question template \u2014 the \"custom question\" a user names themselves rather than picking from Speak's shared library. Requires the OWNER or ADMIN role. The server stamps companyId and forces isSystemTemplate to false, so this template is only ever visible to your company.",
